nd Stop Loss Order">Add Take Profit And Stop Loss Order</h1><div class="flex h-10 flex-shrink-0 items-center"></div></div></div><div class="@container/environment-url z-10 flex items-stretch rounded-xl border border-border-color-base bg-input shadow-sm sticky" style="top:65px"><div class="flex w-0 flex-1 items-stretch p-1"><div class="m-1 flex items-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center h-[24px] rounded-md px-1.5 py-[2px] text-sm font-600 bg-orange-1 text-orange-6 flex h-full max-h-[90px] !rounded"><span class="truncate">POST</span></span></div><div class="flex min-h-[32px] w-0 flex-1 items-center break-all font-400 leading-5 text-color"><div class=""><div style="white-space:normal"><span class="inline-block cursor-default rounded border-[0.5px] border-border-color-base px-2 leading-[23px]" style="font-size:14px"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline hover:decoration-dashed">https://api-futures.kucoin.com</span></span><span class="ml-2" style="font-size:14px"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline hover:decoration-dashed">/api/v1/st-orders</span></span></div></div></div><div class="ml-3 flex items-center gap-1"><button aria-label="Try it" type="button" class="ui-btn ui-btn-primary ui-btn-flex h-full max-h-14 animate-none transition-none @[998px]/environment-url:h-auto"><span role="img" class="appicon app_icon" style="font-size:14px"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img"><path d="M416.768 202.112l1.237333 0.810667 355.413334 236.928c10.24 6.826667 19.797333 13.226667 27.136 19.114666 7.68 6.186667 16.64 14.72 21.845333 27.221334 6.826667 16.512 6.826667 35.114667 0 51.626666-5.205333 12.501333-14.208 21.034667-21.845333 27.221334a393.130667 393.130667 0 0 1-27.136 19.114666l-356.650667 237.738667c-12.544 8.405333-23.893333 15.914667-33.450667 21.12-9.6 5.205333-22.784 11.136-38.144 10.24a67.413333 67.413333 0 0 1-49.749333-26.624c-9.301333-12.288-11.648-26.538667-12